class_name RoomLayouts
## Floor plans for the rooms, drawn with letters.
##
## Each plan is 13 rows of 28 letters (the inside of a room, without walls):
##     .   open floor
##     #   something tall (crates, rocks): blocks walking AND shots
##     ~   something low (water, pits): blocks walking, shots fly over it
##
## The keeper enters in the middle of the left side and leaves in the middle
## of the right side, so keep both ends of row 7 (the middle row) open, and
## keep the centre open too: that is where the reward chest appears.
## If a row is too short or too long the game pads or trims it for you.

